# --- Model Weights & Huge Binaries (>100MB) ---
# GitHub strictly rejects individual files over 100MB.
# Base and quantized weights should be downloaded via scripts or Hugging Face.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.weights
artifacts/gguf/
artifacts/qwen_khwarizmi_merged/
artifacts/qwen_khwarizmi_sft/*.safetensors

